Maidan Garhi, New Delhi – 110068, India<br/></p><br/><b>Email:</b> registrarmpdd@ignou.ac.in<br/><b>Phone:</b> +91-011-29534521, 29572002</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div>
                                        

                                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pills-3" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ImportantFunctionsofMPDD"  ><ul><li>Planning of SLMs requirement.</li>
<li>Execution of complete reprinting work of IGNOU and Printing work of Schools of studies as per SLM requirement.</li>
<li>Maintenance of inventory of study materials and other related items.</li><li>Distribution of study materials to the students.</li>
<li>Distribution of study materials to Regional Centres of IGNOU.</li>
<li>Sale of study materials to the Open University, other Institutions, agents and general public.</li>
<li>Meeting of the SLM printing requirements and special printing jobs like Convocation, Prof. G. Ram Reddy Memorial Lecture, Annual Reports etc. are also responsibility of MPDD.</li>
<li>The Division comprises of seven Units namely, A&F Unit, Computer Unit, Printing Unit, Student Support Cell, Marketing Cell, International Dispatch/Prospectus Unit and Stores.</li>
<li>Tender for Empanelment of Offset Printer for Printing of Study Materials with Text and Cover Paper across India through CPP Portal.</li>
<li>Tender for Laser Typesetter and Graphic Designers through CPP Portal.</li><li>Procurement of P-I, P-II and P-III envelopes through GeM</li></ul>.</div>
